OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FA crisp, dry and frosty         
OL,6,Fmorning. Remaining cold throughout the 
OL,7,Fday, despite the long spells of autumn 
OL,8,Fsunshine. There may be some cloudier   
OL,9,Fintervals in the south, near           
OL,10,FManchester and Liverpool, during the   
OL,11,Fafternoon.                             
OL,13,CTonight:FAnother cold, largely clear   
OL,14,Fnight, though with slightly higher     
OL,15,Ftemperatures for most than on Friday   
OL,16,Fnight. Frosty away from the coasts,    
OL,17,Fwith the hardest frost around the      
OL,18,Ffells of Cumbria.                      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
