OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CSunday:FLong sunny spells amongst      
OL,6,Fpatches of cloud, especially along the 
OL,7,Fcoast. Though temperatures wil be      
OL,8,Fslightly raised compared to Friday, it 
OL,9,Fwill feel cold in the easterly breeze. 
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCalm  
OL,12,Fwith long periods of sunshine on       
OL,13,FMonday. On Tuesday, breezy with spells 
OL,14,Fof rain. Calmer on Wednesday but with  
OL,15,Ffurther intervals of rain and cloud.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
